graph TD
    Developer[Developer / GitHub PR]
    Filesystem[Local Codebase src/]

    CLI[Dev Guardian CLI]
    ASTParser[Tree-sitter AST Parser]

    Hybrid[Hybrid Retriever Layer]
    Memgraph[(Memgraph Cypher DB)]
    Qdrant[(Qdrant Vector DB)]

    Groq[Groq Llama-3.3-70B]
    Langfuse[Langfuse LLMOps]
    
    Supervisor{Supervisor Node}
    Gatekeeper[Gatekeeper Agent]
    RedTeam[Red Team Tester]
    Debate[Debate Mechanism]
    Remediation[Remediation Specialist]

    MCP[Anthropic MCP Server]

    Developer -->|astro_pr.diff| CLI
    Filesystem -->|Source Files| ASTParser

    CLI -->|guardian index| ASTParser
    ASTParser -->|AST Nodes & Metadata| Hybrid
    Hybrid -->|MERGE| Memgraph
    Hybrid -->|Vectors| Qdrant

    CLI -->|guardian evaluate| Hybrid
    Hybrid -->|Context Retrieval| Supervisor

    Supervisor -.->|Parallel Execution| Gatekeeper
    Supervisor -.->|Parallel Execution| RedTeam

    Gatekeeper <-->|API Calls| Groq
    RedTeam <-->|API Calls| Groq
    Groq -.->|Tracing| Langfuse

    Gatekeeper -->|PASS / WARN / FAIL| Supervisor
    RedTeam -->|PASS / WARN / FAIL| Supervisor

    Supervisor -->|Agreement: PASS| End((Accept PR))
    
    Supervisor -->|Disagreement| Debate
    Debate -->|Consensus: REJECT| End2((Reject PR))
    Debate -->|Consensus: REMEDIATE| Remediation

    Supervisor -->|Agreement: FAIL or WARN| Remediation
    Remediation -->|Writes Fixing Diff| End3((Autonomous PR Fix))

    End3 -.->|Pushed via IDE| MCP
